`measure-strategy` subagent to correct a strategy-owned canonical-contract
error introduced in commits `5a1a561a` ("docs(t2): reconcile phase 4
strategy") and `16f09da8` ("docs(t2): phase 4 strategy log audit receipt").
Immutable baseline: `476835906509e2c550ed98e0d23e89c7326b7bdc`. Role-base
